OL,4,CTown plagued by guerrilla parking,     
OL,5,Ccouncillor says                        
OL,6,GA councillor who condemned a "plague   
OL,7,Gof guerrilla parking" in a Surrey town 
OL,8,Ghas urged drivers to use official      
OL,9,Gparking spaces instead of loading bays.
OL,11,FGeorge Hesse, who represents Castle    
OL,12,Fward at Waverley Borough Council and   
OL,13,FFarnham Town Council, said some bays   
OL,14,Fbrought in by improvement works in     
OL,15,FFarnham had yet to be marked with      
OL,16,Fyellow lines or signs to show parking  
OL,17,Frestrictions.                          
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
