OL,4,CPolice agree settlement with family    
OL,5,Cafter teen's death                     
OL,6,GThe family of a teenager who took his  
OL,7,Gown life after going missing have      
OL,8,Gsettled with Sussex Police after High  
OL,9,GCourt legal action.                    
OL,11,FJason Pulman, 15, was found dead in    
OL,12,FHampden Park, Eastbourne, in April     
OL,13,F2022.                                  
OL,15,FAn inquest into his death in 2024      
OL,16,Ffound police "responded inadequately"  
OL,17,Fto his disappearance. Jason's parents  
OL,18,Fsay they told police he was            
OL,19,Ftransgender, had a history of self     
OL,20,Fharm and attempted suicide, and        
OL,21,Fopportunities to find him were missed. 
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
