OL,4,CPlans to demolish former WW2 barracks  
OL,5,Capproved                               
OL,6,GTen former barracks built in Surrey    
OL,7,Gduring World War Two will be           
OL,8,Gdemolished and replaced with modern    
OL,9,Galternatives, a council has confirmed. 
OL,11,FPlans to demolish the buildings known  
OL,12,Fas the Dorking huts were approved by   
OL,13,FMole Valley District Council on        
OL,14,FTuesday night.                         
OL,16,FThe huts were used by Canadian forces  
OL,17,Fduring the war but are now home to     
OL,18,Fbusinesses like Windibank Auctioneers  
OL,19,Fand the Green Room Theatre.            
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
